# Forge lifecycle artifacts are local; the surface declarations + the conformance
# re-execution runner + the conformance matrix are tracked (they are the gates,
# not scratch — the runner's CI deployment needs the matrix on a fresh clone).
/.forge/*
!/.forge/critical-surfaces
!/.forge/conformance-surfaces
!/.forge/conformance-verify.sh
!/.forge/conformance/
/.forge/conformance/*/
!.forge/conformance/b2-ra-conformance-roundtrip
/.kimosabe/
